From: c4pp4
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Do not autostart in Cinnamon

Cinnamon provides its own network applet. Without nm-applet in the
cinnamon-session autostart blacklist (removed for the Unity session),
hide the autostart entry in Cinnamon explicitly.

Signed-off-by: c4pp4
---
--- a/nm-applet.desktop.in
+++ b/nm-applet.desktop.in
@@ -6,5 +6,5 @@
 Terminal=false
 Type=Application
 NoDisplay=true
-NotShowIn=KDE;GNOME;
+NotShowIn=KDE;GNOME;X-Cinnamon;
 X-GNOME-UsesNotifications=true
